\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {III}{\ignorespaces Deep-splice TTFT vs.\ depth ($n{=}15$ trials/cell). Never-regress holds everywhere (top-1 OK, $D_{\mathrm  {KL}}(\mathbf  {p}_0 \parallel \mathbf  {p}_{\mathrm  {splice}}) \approx 0$); speedup narrows to parity as recompute escalates. Eq.~\eqref  {eq:adaptive} reproduces the $R$(\%) column exactly (verified), so the recompute schedule can be audited without the code. Speedup intervals propagate the per-cell bootstrap $95\%$ CIs of the prefill and splice medians (independent timing loops). Source: \texttt  {\relax \fontsize  {9}{10pt}\selectfont  deep\_splice\_ttft.json}.}}{6}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:perf}{{III}{6}{Deep-splice TTFT vs.\ depth ($n{=}15$ trials/cell). Never-regress holds everywhere (top-1 OK, $D_{\mathrm {KL}}(\mathbf {p}_0 \parallel \mathbf {p}_{\mathrm {splice}}) \approx 0$); speedup narrows to parity as recompute escalates. Eq.~\eqref {eq:adaptive} reproduces the $R$(\%) column exactly (verified), so the recompute schedule can be audited without the code. Speedup intervals propagate the per-cell bootstrap $95\%$ CIs of the prefill and splice medians (independent timing loops). Source: \code {deep\_splice\_ttft.json}}{table.3}{}}
