\newlabel{fig:ttft}{{4}{6}{TTFT speedup vs.\ depth for the two recompute curves (\code {deep\_splice\_ttft.json}). Higher $K$ delays full recompute, sustaining speedup deeper at the cost of a larger repaired suffix; both converge to parity as $R(n_{\mathrm {past}})\!\to \!100\%$}{figure.4}{}}
